        },
        {
          "text": "Izibusiso zikayihlo zedlula izibusiso zabokhokho bami kuze kube semkhawulweni wezintaba zaphakade; ziyakuba sekhanda likaJosefa nasokhakhayini lwekhanda lalowo owahlukaniswa nabafowabo.",
